1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,800
I've been using some insanely good apps
lately. But then I had a thought...

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:11,600
What if I could recreate their best
features... just by vibe coding?

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:21,800
First up, Wispr Flow. I wanted voice typing,
AI cleanup, and a smooth floating interface.

4
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:28,000
A few prompts, some generated
code, a couple of bugs...

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,800
okay, a lot of bugs.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,800
And suddenly, it's actually working.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,600
Meet my own take on AI-powered dictation.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:46,400
Built my way, with the
features I actually want.

9
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,600
And this is just the beginning.

10
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,200
One popular app at a time.

11
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:58,600
Let's see how far AI can take us.
